WEBVTT

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.940
<b>Episode 21: The Last Battle</b>

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.290
Morning, Neu.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.150
Yes. Morning, Yuuhi.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.490
It's cold.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.500
Princess, did you dream this morning?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.650
Yeah, I probably had the same dream you did.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.960
Hey. Hello, Beast Knights.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.430
Pardon me for intruding in your dreams.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.430
Today... anytime is fine,

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.330
but could you all gather 
together in one spot for me?

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:48.400
I'll transport you to 
an open space from there.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.800
The time has come.

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.630
Today we'll have our last battle.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.950
I'll see you later.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.540
I wish he wouldn't pop up in our dreams.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.520
Today's the last time.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:04.950
Yuu-kun.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.000
I know.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.590
Subaru-chan.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.920
Yuki!

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.970
Oh, Subaru, Ly!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.680
Hey! Long, Yukimachi!

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.340
You're going in your uniform, 
too, Subaru-chan?

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.370
Yeah.

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:26.760
I wonder why?

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.050
Just felt like it.

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.500
Same.

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.170
Let's go visit Master's grave tomorrow.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:34.050
Yeah.

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:36.730
Though we might be too tired 
to move tomorrow.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.360
Oh, that's true.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:42.820
Tarou-kun.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.700
Once this is over, I'll be a student of 
that technical school you wanted to go to.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.880
I'm heading out now.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.510
You're going in your uniform, Hanako?

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.220
Yeah.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.030
My heart is racing.

00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:00.450
The twelfth,

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.770
Animus,

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:03.800
the Princess and Amamiya-kun...

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:07.700
Sia, do you think I can beat them?

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.730
Who knows?

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:10.480
But you'll manage somehow.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.010
You're strong.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.070
Thanks, Sia.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:21.850
It doesn't look like you got much sleep,

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.520
so are you okay?

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:26.000
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:26.530
Hey!

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:28.600
We're going the same way!

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:30.980
H-Hello, Shinonome-san.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:34.010
Hm? What, you nervous?

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:35.290
Yeah.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.570
You'll be fine!

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.880
We'll definitely win!

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.050
More importantly, Takkun,

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.640
you're almost a middle schooler, right?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.380
Are you going to join any clubs?

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:46.120
I haven't decided.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.270
Hyou-kun, are you really going 
with <i>that</i> for your twelfth one?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:57.120
Yeah, it's the form I trust most of all.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.710
Hmm... I'm concerned.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.220
It'll be fine.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.290
Now, shall we get going, Kuh?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:13.130
Dance, would you let me ride on your back 
on the way to our final battle?

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.770
Nagumo, you are a great friend.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.670
However, I wholeheartedly refuse!

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:23.110
Stubborn to the very end.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.220
So are you.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.270
It's fine. I'll handle the clean-up.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.990
Onee-chan, we're heading out.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:32.960
Yeah.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.480
Thank you for the meal.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.070
Amamiya.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.120
Yes?

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.670
Come by again tomorrow.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.740
The pollock roe expires after tomorrow.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.440
Tomorrow...

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.200
Sure.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:49.230
Let's go, Yuu-kun.

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:50.240
Right.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:12.530
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:17.830
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:21.690
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.060
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:28.660
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.960
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:37.920
<i>Now with your courage, 
let's soar into the sky.</i>

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.550
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:45.630
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.380
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:55.920
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:59.870
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.880
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:11.620
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.890
Everyone here?

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.880
We'll be fine.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.660
There's nothing our attack can't destroy.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.870
Asahina, we'll be counting on you 
to cover us while we charge it up.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.100
Normally, the Knights 
should be protecting you,

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.600
but you're the strongest one of us.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.390
Yeah!

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:59.280
Well, even if you don't charge it in time,

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:03.170
I'll still defeat it anyway, 
so take your time.

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.630
Anything you'd like to say to us, Anima?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.690
No.

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.430
Same as ever until the end.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.150
Hey, sorry for the wait.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.100
Animus!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.820
You're all here.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.530
Well, shall we go?

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.180
Go?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.160
Huh?

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.270
We're not in the mountains?

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.590
This is an awfully open space.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.050
The princess isn't here!

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:51.970
Ahh, sorry, I forgot one.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.430
What an awfully petty thing to do.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.620
I thought I was being kind

00:06:56.620 --> 00:07:00.800
by not leaving Subaru-chan 
and Yukimachi-chan behind, as well.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.410
Well, everyone, I pray for your success.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.830
This is bad.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.990
What do we do?

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.210
Don't panic.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.240
Asahina has Anima with her.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.880
Just get into position!

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:14.220
Be ready to attack at any moment!

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.660
All right!

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.850
Cluck, don't be scared, Subaru!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.590
Same to you, Ly!

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.550
Got nothing to say?

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.650
It's the last battle, Mu.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.560
You happy to hold hands with Amami, Yako?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:36.510
You know this isn't the time for that, Sia.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.630
It's the moment of truth, Nagumo.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.480
Yeah, it is, Dance.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:46.150
I wonder what his twelfth will be like, Kuh.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.980
I hope it's weak-looking.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.740
All your friends are brave.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.760
Fear not. we will win, Hanako.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.480
You really don't feel any anxiety do you, Kir?

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:57.560
Thanks.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.800
What will you do, Taiyou?

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.020
I don't know.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.010
But for now, I'll do whatever I want to, Loki.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.940
This battle's likely to get rough,

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.300
so you should settle on the ground.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.440
That's true.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:15.550
Don't lose, Yukimachi.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:20.120
What happens to you guys 
after this battle is over?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:21.970
We'll disappear.

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:25.190
Win or lose, today we bid farewell, Yuuhi.

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:26.990
I see.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.520
Thanks for everything up to today.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:30.800
Thank you, friend.

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:34.810
I should be the one thanking you, my friend.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:38.990
Though it's still too early 
for our farewells.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.120
That's true.

00:08:58.960 --> 00:08:59.720
Here it comes!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.530
It's huge!

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.500
Though that makes it easier to hit!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.240
Here we go!

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.710
Ultimate Holding Field!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.210
Wish Granting Light (Meteor Arrow)!

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.810
It hit?!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:56.780
It missed?!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.610
But it was powerful enough!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.810
I got the hang of it now!

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.700
We'll aim the next shot at its center!

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.010
Prepare the second volley!

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.530
Calm your breathing!

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:11.620
<i>It's starting to move. 
Will we make it in time?</i>

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:18.380
Princess!

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:22.550
Samidare Punch!

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:43.530
Asahina really could defeat it by herself.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:47.790
<i>That's the punch of the girl 
who will destroy this planet?</i>

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.380
Whoa! Princess! So cool! 
You're awesome! I'm shaking!

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:53.790
Shimaki-san?!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.130
It takes time for the second volley!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.010
I'll send Asahina-san backup.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.090
Creation Field: Kybele!

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:01.620
Ende!

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:03.050
Meow!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.230
Kuh?!

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:06.970
Huge!

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.310
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.010
Go! Ende!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.620
I made it in time!

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.160
Damn Animus, pulling stupid stunts.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.890
Though, look at that wound.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.450
They might have beaten it even without you.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:34.640
We can't have that!

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:36.290
Then I wouldn't get to show off!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.110
<i>We'll finish it with the next shot.</i>

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.550
<i>It's an overwhelming victory.</i>

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:47.780
<i>Though, without "Wish Granting Light,"</i>

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.880
<i>we would have been wiped out with 
the first blow, unable to do anything.</i>

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.820
<i>The ones who paved the way for our future</i>

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:55.410
<i>were these two, Subaru and Yukimachi.</i>

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.980
<i>I always thought fighting to protect
things was an adult's job,</i>

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:01.450
<i>but I was being arrogant.</i>

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.820
<i>Children have the power 
to protect their future, as well!</i>

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:11.280
<i>These children obtained their future 
the day "Wish Granting Light" was completed.</i>

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.290
Launching the second volley!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.250
Wish!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.210
Granting!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.420
Light!

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.010
W-We defeated it.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.490
What incredible power.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:06.970
Firing off... two shots... 
is incredibly... exhausting.

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.930
Akane, you're up. Heal.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.660
Oh, right.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:12.880
Over there.

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:13.590
Huh?

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.440
There're lots of homes.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.860
It's all right, no one's there.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.570
Did you evacuate them?

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.030
No.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:31.370
This island is a stage floating 
over the pacific ocean.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.380
Animus created it.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.370
Good work, everyone.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.690
Animus!

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:42.840
Though this is the first time nine 
whole knights have survived this long.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.430
This is a waste of time.

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:46.300
Amamiya, let's go.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.160
Huh?

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:50.510
You're the key.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.100
Got it.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:57.410
Oh, you planning on activating that thing?

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:03.410
Well, can you really stop my ultimate golem?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.200
It's a showdown, Anima.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:09.490
Biscuit Hammer!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.290
Activate!

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.580
It moved!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:32.570
Though, where are we now?

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:36.350
This is the space inside 
the Blues Drive Monster.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.640
Anima, what do I need to do?

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:41.180
Proceed to the core of Blues,

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:44.110
and collect your heart along the way.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.560
My heart?

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:51.260
So far, your mind has been coming 
to the gate on the surface of Blues.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:57.570
This has let your mind seep into Blues 
and deepen your connection to it,

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:00.610
but now your physical body will need 
to gather those fragments of your spirit.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.750
You can't activate Blues directly yourself?

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:09.700
Anima has been pouring a lot of power 
into the Knights and Squires.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:16.470
So, since you have the strongest 
connection to me and Anima, uh...

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.930
You don't have to force 
yourself to explain it.

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:23.940
Well, for lots of reasons, 
you're the only one who can do it,

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.900
and we know that you can.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.900
In other words...

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:30.910
...we believe in you.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.720
Run!

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.460
Your conviction will create the path!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.690
My conviction creates the path?

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:50.520
Yuuhi.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.520
You'll just have to believe in them.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.120
That's right.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.300
Believe in them.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.150
Wow!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:10.030
The stones are moving, one after another!

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.960
The path is forming for us!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:25.310
Go! Yuuhi, activate Blues Drive Monster!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.140
Oh, that's...

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.830
Humans are scumbags.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:37.600
Humans are scumbags.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.200
That's a fragment of my spirit?

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.370
Take my hand!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:53.030
The child Yuuhi became chains!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:17:00.290
Even though... I was sick 
of being saved by others.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.300
Another!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:03.000
What time is this Yuuhi from?!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.080
Come with me!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.060
A spear?!

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:14.470
It was when I realized Shinonome-san 
passed his skills on to me!

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.680
Another! This one's in front!

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.160
It's okay.

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.820
I'm here with you.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.640
I did it all for you.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.240
Huh?! Is that Yuuhi?!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.730
From when?!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:28.430
Let's go!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.490
Is that it?!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.410
A button?! So simple!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.080
Activate, Blues!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.520
It moved!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.850
Crush it, Biscuit Hammer!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.020
Pierce it, Blues!

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:38.340
It lost?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.750
I've been waiting for this!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:42.050
For one of these super weapons to shatter!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.870
For this very moment!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:48.680
Princess!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.270
Wha?!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.230
Samidare?!

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.940
Ultra!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.690
Samidare!

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.420
Punch!

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.890
Wow.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.550
The Biscuit Hammer...

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.620
shattered!

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:20.260
Is this...

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:22.900
really happening?

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:24.470
Samidare-san...

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.820
Princess!

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:51.490
She reconstructed broken fragments of Blues,

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:57.160
overwrote its power, and 
surpassed the Biscuit Hammer?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.490
Then she stole more fragments 
of that to enlarge it?

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:03.100
What psychic prowess...

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:06.760
So this is Samidare?

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:15.290
My Biscuit Hammer... was shattered?

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.740
Our friend, and your enemy,

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.370
has shattered your means 
of destroying the Earth.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.920
So, what will you do now, Animus?

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:38.790
You've sure done it now.

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.990
I'm used to creating the Biscuit Hammer,

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:49.070
but it still takes nearly six months 
to pour enough power into it.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.520
So you don't intend to give up 
on destroying the Earth?

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:57.180
Nope. Of course I don't.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:58.980
So, shall we fight?

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:00.940
In that case, here we go.

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:04.080
It's the final battle!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.140
There!

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.550
The sky?!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:12.330
He teleported us again?!

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:14.780
Everyone, use your 
holding field at your feet!

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:18.170
Break it up into moments like 
Amamiya taught you and land safely!

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:26.440
Then I'll prepare the ground while I can.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:33.940
Huh?!

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:35.370
Wh-What's that?!

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:36.940
Focus!

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:39.500
Now, come here.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:40.980
Huh?

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.860
Gravity Accelerated Kick!

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:52.690
What a reckless landing!

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:56.250
It's exhausting enough just landing 
the way Amamiya taught us!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:01.880
Akane, get back!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.170
You're the key here!

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.680
Recover your own stamina, then back us up!

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:06.470
Yeah.

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:10.190
Nice kick. I'll have to pay you back.

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:16.230
Shinonome-san?!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.940
That's nothing!

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:20.270
He's alive!

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:23.040
Shock Balls!

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:25.040
This attack isn't powerful 
enough to kill outright.

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:29.910
This is our last battle after all, 
so let's enjoy it as long as possible

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:34.900
before your spirits break.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:41.820
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:54.430
<i>Hey, you know, I wish</i>

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>I was the only person in the world.</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:02.630
<i>I didn't want to learn I was all alone.</i>

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:04.980
<i>Ahh, I'm so empty</i>

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:08.350
<i>and I just wanted to shine, 
but I'm so weak.</i>

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:13.120
<i>I was waiting for the courage 
to stop my trembling.</i>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.870
<i>I looked up at the sky I couldn't fly in</i>

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.110
<i>To avoid getting hurt.</i>

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:23.050
<i>But now it's goodbye to that old me.</i>

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:28.310
<i>We smiled, we cried, and 
I learned another side of you.</i>

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:31.760
<i>The pain you hide, what hides 
behind your smile, this world,</i>

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.640
<i>I'll destroy it all,</i>

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:39.010
<i>So I'll run, and I'll fall, 
and I'll still rise up again,</i>

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:43.380
<i>Because tonight I'm coming to save you.</i>

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:55.750
<i>We can become heroes, even from nothing.</i>

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:12.000
<b>Next Episode:
Lucifer and the Biscuit Hammer</b>
